{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>So that you remember.</b> So that you be free from vain thoughts, and through this you will remember the signs of the Torah, by which you recognize the greatness of El and His lovingkindness." "<b>And you shall do all My commandments.</b> And through this you shall perform all My commandments out of love and awe." "<b>And you shall be holy to your Elohim.</b> And through this you shall be holy before Him for eternal life, as He intended in saying (Exodus 19:6): וְאַתֶּם תִּהְיוּ לִי מַמְלֶכֶת כֹּהֲנִים וְגוֹי קָדוֹשׁ — \"and you shall be to Me a kingdom of priests and a holy nation.\""], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:00.750551852Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}